{title: Jaan Hai Meri}
{artist: Labon Pe Naam Hai Tera Armaan Malik Amaal Malik}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G] Aaye The Is [Em] Tarah Se Tum,        Jaise [C] Koyi Ho Khwaab [D] Naya
[G] Bas Yaadein Reh [Em] Gayi Dekho,        Hum Mein [C] Tum Mein Jo Tha Na [D] Raha
[Bm] Ho Puchhta Hoon Main Khud Se,        [C] Door Kyun Raha Tujhse
[Am] Jaate Jaate Sun Le Tu [D] Zara,        Labon Pe [G] Naam Hai Tera
Haan Dil Mein [Em] Yaad Hai [D] Teri,        Tu Mera [Am] Na Hua Toh Kya
Tu Phir Bhi [D] Jaan Hai [G] Meri,        [G] Tujhko Apna Kabhi
Kehne Se [Bm] Pehle Socha Nahi,        [C] Khwaab Mein Bhi Tera
