Tu Mera [Am] Na Hua Toh Kya,        Tu Phir Bhi [D] Jaan Hai [G] Meri
[Em] Jis Din Yeh Tujhe Bhool Gaya,        Us [D] Din Tham Jayega
Yeh Dil [C] Kuchh Na Kar Paye [D] ga,        Na Ek Pal [C] Bhi Jee Paye [G] ga
[Em] Meri Tarah Tujhko Jab Ek Din,        [D] Ho Hi Jayega
Yeh Ishq Tab [C] Samajh Mein Aaye [D] ga,        Tu Khud Ko [C] Rok Na Paye [G] ga
[G] Aaoge Ek [Em] Din Chal Ke,        Meri [C] Raahon Pe Tum [D] Dekhna
